# Suricata LuCI

User-facing name is **Suricata** (menu JSON `title`, view `E('h2')`). Package / rpcd / CSS stay `luci-app-threat-prevention`, `luci.threat-prevention`, `.luci-app-threat-prevention`.

Do not restore **Threat Prevention** as the menu or page title.

- Vendor `.rules` are read-only; tunings in UCI `suricata.s${sid}` (do not `uci delete` the section on re-enable)
- Apply via `suricata-config-apply` → `tp-rules-apply` + `tp-policy-apply`
- Footer Save & Apply only; Policy tab uses **Save policies**
- No Blocky/Snort header cross-links; no CM5 / 2.5 GbE copy in views
- `rpc.declare` needs `expect: { '': {} }`; buttons `'type': 'button'`
